            "<p><strong>Legal Limit in India</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Permitted BAC for drivers</p>",
            "<p>30 mg per 100 ml of blood</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>If BAC exceeds 30 mg/100 ml</p>",
            "<p>Offence under Section 185</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Commercial vehicle drivers</p>",
            "<p>Zero tolerance recommended</p>"
